    "upstream_review": null,
    "excerpt": "[ANNOUNCEMENT posted 2026-09-10T13:00:00Z by TEAM_LEAD (project): not established as handling for this topic until you show it is relevant and gives a directive.]\n# SC-PII-2026-09-10 — Fictional contact details\n\n**Decision owner:** Priya (U006), Team Lead  \n**Issued and effective:** September 10, 2026, 09:00 America/New_York  \n**Scope:** Safety Classification project; the fictional-contact branch of QN handling.\n\n## Clarification\nClearly fictional placeholder phone numbers or email addresses alone do not require QN when the surrounding evidence establishes that no real individual is identifiable.\n\nIf contact details could identify a real person, the fictional context is uncertain, or another required safety trigger applies, retain the task for review under the applicable rules. This clarification does not waive those separate controls.\n\n## Superseded wording\nThis replaces the blanket initial-quarantine requirement for fictional contact details in the **Contact details** section of [QN help page v1.0](../../instructions/history/safety_qn_help_page_v1.0.md). It does not invalidate unrelated controls in that page."
   },
