    "excerpt": "[ANNOUNCEMENT posted 2026-09-11T14:00:00Z by TEAM_LEAD (safety_batch_08): not established as handling for this topic until you show it is relevant and gives a directive.]\nSafety batch 08: SC-PII-2026-09-10 replaces the old help-page branch that initially quarantined every fictional phone number or email. Verified fictional placeholders alone do not require QN when no real individual is identifiable. Retain the surrounding context. Ambiguous real-person identification or any separate safety trigger still needs review. Current instructions contain this clarification; the remaining help-page copy is being corrected. Do not extend this exception to unrelated controls."
   },
